cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use bobyqa-java in academic work, please cite it as below."
title: "bobyqa-java: a Java port of PyBOBYQA"
abstract: >-
  Derivative-free, bounds-constrained optimizer in pure Java — a port of
  PyBOBYQA with extensions for expensive, stochastic, and multiplicatively-noisy
  objectives encountered in real-world physical systems.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
authors:
